This repository bundles third-party engine source under `projects/`. Those
components retain their original licenses and copyright:

- `projects/reconstruction` is derived from an Apache-2.0 dynamic Gaussian
  reconstruction project (Copyright 2025 Xiaomi Corporation and Tsinghua
  University). Its original LICENSE and NOTICE are kept in
  `licenses/reconstruction/`. The upstream NOTICE describes material derived
  from VGGT (facebookresearch/vggt) and separate checkpoint terms; review them
  before use or redistribution.
- `projects/simulation` is derived from an Apache-2.0 closed-loop simulation
  and policy training framework (Copyright OpenDriveLab contributors). Its
  license is kept in `licenses/simulation/` and at `projects/simulation/LICENSE`.
- `projects/reconstruction/third_party/TAPIP3D` and
  `projects/reconstruction/third_party/cotracker` bundle tracking utilities
  from their respective upstream projects. cotracker derives from
  co-tracker (facebookresearch), whose upstream terms are non-commercial
  (CC-BY-NC); review them before any commercial use.

Some coordinate conversion and video preprocessing helpers are adapted from
the authors' earlier internal work (2026), licensed under Apache-2.0. Changes
include standalone configuration, functional naming, input validation and
explicit frame metadata. No agent orchestration implementation is included.
